00:00:08.406 --> 00:00:09.301
much each part

00:00:09.125 --> 00:00:09.832
of a model

00:00:09.644 --> 00:00:10.658
hurts output when

00:00:10.469 --> 00:00:12.155
compressed and allocates

00:00:11.967 --> 00:00:12.768
bits to fit

00:00:12.580 --> 00:00:13.617
