00:00:13.686 --> 00:00:14.723
its Gemma 4

00:00:14.535 --> 00:00:16.115
E2B GGUF has

00:00:15.926 --> 00:00:17.424
12x lower KL

00:00:17.271 --> 00:00:18.791
than Q4KM at

00:00:18.603 --> 00:00:19.699
