00:00:28.956 --> 00:00:30.595
from 8 GB iPhones

00:00:30.407 --> 00:00:31.055
upward

00:00:31.574 --> 00:00:32.930
LookAtMyQuant 2 takes

00:00:32.741 --> 00:00:33.732
Qwen3 .

00:00:33.543 --> 00:00:36.467
5-4B to 1.23 GB

00:00:36.586 --> 00:00:37.871
2.3 bits per

00:00:37.683 --> 00:00:38.189
